# Files owned by the user — fern generate will not overwrite these.
cli/hedra/custom.rs
README.md

# Hand-fixed runtime file: serializes the PAGER env-var tests (flaky in CI).
# The fern-cli-generator runtime doesn't carry this fix yet; regeneration
# must not revert it. Drop this entry once the fix lands upstream.
src/pager.rs

# Deliberately NOT ignored: Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock are both generator-owned.
# The generator emits the whole workspace — the CLI's own deps (clap, keyring,
# tokio-tungstenite, the TLS feature matrix) included — plus a Cargo.lock that
# resolves them. Leaving both to the generator keeps manifest and lockfile
# moving together in one regeneration PR, so `cargo check --locked` passes by
# construction. Re-adding Cargo.lock here reopens ENG-10048: the bot cannot
# update a lockfile it does not own, so any generated dependency change fails CI.

# Release pipeline (cargo-dist) + CI + Dependabot are hand-maintained.
dist-workspace.toml
.github/
